 cameron's pancreas  and kidney somebody gave me  part of someone that they loved  and because of that i get a second  chance at life within weeks roberts was  writing her own letter pouring her heart  out to the donor's family the minute i  read lisey's letter i knew that i wanted  to talk to her months of phone calls led  to this moment there she is when the  families meet for the very first time  [Music]  if i could prevent one mom from feeling  what i felt i would do it 100 times over  again  [Music]  now cameron was able to donate five  organs saving the lives of three people  his mother wants to encourage other  parents and even adults to consider  becoming a donor she says because even  in the darkest moment you can still  choose light and life for someone else
 

